{
  "id": "158",
  "title": "Ordering at McDonald's",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2016-07-16",
  "synopsis": "Sometimes when you're in China you might want to visit McDonald for a trusty old hamburger. Here we learn how to order in Chinese.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/175/152c45023377f3f0578573c59f90312ab62c88c2.mp3?1698321430",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "在麦当劳点菜\n\n小丽：你好，我要一个巨无霸套餐。\n服务员：不好意思，那个卖完了。\n小丽：那我单点吧。我要一个吉士汉堡，一个大薯条，一杯大杯可乐和一个巧克力圣代。\n服务员：好的。\n小丽：啊，再加一个苹果派，就这些了。在这儿吃。谢谢。\n服务员：好的。\n小丽：能给我两包番茄酱吗？\n服务员：好的。",
    "traditional": "在麥當勞點菜\n\n小麗：你好，我要一個巨無霸套餐。\n服務員：不好意思，那個賣完了。\n小麗：那我單點吧。我要一個吉士漢堡，一個大薯條，一杯大杯可樂和一個巧克力聖代。\n服務員：好的。\n小麗：啊，再加一個蘋果派，就這些了。在這兒吃。謝謝。\n服務員：好的。\n小麗：能給我兩包番茄醬嗎？\n服務員：好的。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ordering at McDonald's"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小丽：你好，我要一个巨无霸套餐。",
      "traditional": "小麗：你好，我要一個巨無霸套餐。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lì nǐ hǎo wǒ yào yí ge jù wú bà tào cān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Li: Hi, I would like a Big Mac meal."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "服务员：不好意思，那个卖完了。",
      "traditional": "服務員：不好意思，那個賣完了。",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán bù hǎo yì si nà ge mài wán le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Sorry, it's sold out."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小丽：那我单点吧。我要一个吉士汉堡，一个大薯条，一杯大杯可乐和一个巧克力圣代。",
      "traditional": "小麗：那我單點吧。我要一個吉士漢堡，一個大薯條，一杯大杯可樂和一個巧克力聖代。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lì nà wǒ dān diǎn ba wǒ yào yí ge jí shì hàn bǎo yí ge dà shǔ tiáo yì bēi dà bēi kě lè hé yí ge qiǎo kè lì shèng dài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Li: I'll order single items then. I want one cheeseburger, one large fries, one large coke and one chocolate sundae."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "服务员：好的。",
      "traditional": "服務員：好的。",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Ok."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小丽：啊，再加一个苹果派，就这些了。在这儿吃。谢谢。",
      "traditional": "小麗：啊，再加一個蘋果派，就這些了。在這兒吃。謝謝。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lì a zài jiā yí ge píng guǒ pài jiù zhè xiē le zài zhè‘r chī xiè xie",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Li: Oh, and one apple pie, and that's it. I'll eat here, thanks."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "服务员：好的。",
      "traditional": "服務員：好的。",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Ok."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小丽：能给我两包番茄酱吗？",
      "traditional": "小麗：能給我兩包番茄醬嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lì néng gěi wǒ liǎng bāo fān qié jiàng ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Li: Can you give me two packets of ketchup?"
    },
    {
